                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/622.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Secretary of the First Central American
                            Conference.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January 4,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Accept my greetings and good wishes for yourself and members of the
                    conference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
